# Normalise line endings for everyone regardless of local git config:
# the repo's text files are stored as LF; without this, a contributor's
# own core.autocrlf setting decides what they end up with, which produces
# noisy whole-file diffs and false merge conflicts when it disagrees with
# whatever produced the last commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
